reviewer_gates[5]{theme,triggers,preflight,avoid,receipt}:
  shared_ownership,"shared package, common styles, local glue, duplicate helper, cross-repo consumer","check owner; enumerate consumers; prefer additive opt-in primitive; keep rollout explicit","local workaround before ownership check; silent contract break","scope check: ownership, contract impact, rollout"
  test_doubles,"copied API, duplicated test alias, hand-maintained fake, stale double","prefer real behavior, owned harness, typed double, or shared external-system fake","hand-maintained mirror of repo-owned behavior; two mock mechanisms for one behavior","mock boundary, why it is safe, validation lane"
  async_readiness,"first open, hidden state, queued update, stale data, readiness, replay, cleanup","verify initial state, current-state seed, replay, cleanup, hidden and rendered modes","queued history as source of truth; one-path manual cleanup","manual matrix for readiness and stale-state modes"
  canonical_tooling,"duplicate aliases, parallel installers, overlapping test harnesses, browser automation split","choose one foundation; document app-local exception; validate through authoritative lane","two systems for same job; framework conversion by copy-paste","tooling source of truth and commands run"
  temporary_fallback,"upstream pending fix, UI workaround, defensive escape hatch, manual sync code","label temporary; name removal trigger; verify simpler design failed","permanent workaround with no owner or expiry","risk, owner, removal condition"
